{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43276","headline":"海水不扬波 · 李沛","name":"海水不扬波","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"明朝崇大道，寰海免波扬。\n既合千年圣，能安百谷王。\n天心随泽广，水德共灵长。\n不挠鱼弥乐，无澜苇可航。\n化流沾率土，恩浸及殊方。\n岂只朝宗国，惟闻有越裳。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李沛","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43276.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43276","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}